    <!--
      TcxunitConfig.cs, TcxunitProcessRunner.cs, and ResultsToolWindowControl.xaml.cs use
      System.Text.Json directly (swapped off System.Web.Script.Serialization.JavaScriptSerializer
      per TcXunit-cmp, so TcxunitConfig.cs could be source-linked into tests/TcXunit.Vsix.Tests
      the way TcxunitModels.cs already was). Same package versions
      TcAgentPlugin/src/TcAgent already ships and proves work under XAE Shell's devenv (see that
      project's TcAgent.csproj Content block and ChatToolWindowPackage.cs); System.Text.Json's
      net461 asset plus its own net461-compatible dependency closure. Referenced without an
      explicit assembly Version/PublicKeyToken (unlike the WebView2 references above) since only
      System.Text.Json's and System.Runtime.CompilerServices.Unsafe's exact assembly versions are
      independently confirmed (via TcAgent's own ProvideBindingRedirection NewVersion targets,
      6.0.0.10 and 6.0.0.0 respectively); a bare Reference name plus HintPath resolves off the
      file directly rather than risking a wrong guessed identity for the rest.
    -->
